{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2094","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Boneca Ambalabu"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Boneca Ambalabu gives you a sequence of $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1,a_2,\\ldots,a_n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output the maximum value of $$$(a_k\\oplus a_1)+(a_k\\oplus a_2)+\\ldots+(a_k\\oplus a_n)$$$ among all $$$1 \\leq k \\leq n$$$. Note that $$$\\oplus$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#XOR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise XOR operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains an integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\leq t \\leq 10^4$$$) – the number of independent test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains an integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n\\leq 2\\cdot 10^5$$$) – the length of the array."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1,a_2,\\ldots,a_n$$$ ($$$0 \\leq a_i \\lt 2^{30}$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$2\\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output the maximum value on a new line."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n3\n18 18 18\n5\n1 2 4 8 16\n5\n8 13 4 5 15\n6\n625 676 729 784 841 900\n1\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n79\n37\n1555\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, the best we can do is $$$(18\\oplus18)+(18\\oplus18)+(18\\oplus18)=0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, we choose $$$k=5$$$ to get $$$(16\\oplus1)+(16\\oplus2)+(16\\oplus4)+(16\\oplus8)+(16\\oplus16)=79$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"2094E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2094/problem/E"}